## Part 1: Simple Markdown
:::

===
# Headers

# This is H1

## This is H2

### This is H3

===
# Text Formatting

Regular paragraph with **bold**, *italic*, and _underlined_ text.

Combine them: **_bold italic_** and **_bold underline_**.

===
# Lists

Unordered:
- First item
- Second item with **bold**
- Third item with *italic*

Ordered:
1. Step one
2. Step two with _underline_
3. Step three

===
# Quotes

> Simple quote

> Quote with **bold** and *italic* text

> Quote with _underlined_ text

===
::: {background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%)'; padding: '40px'; border-radius: '15px'; color: 'white'; text-align: 'center'}
## Part 2: Code Highlighting
:::

===
# Mode: all

```javascript [highlight:all]
function sum(a, b) {
    return a + b;
}
```

===
# Mode: line-by-line

```python [highlight:line-by-line]
def factorial(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return 1
    return n * factorial(n - 1)
```

===
# Mode: block

```java [highlight:block]
public class User {
    private String name;

    public User(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }

    public String getName() {
        return name;
    }
}
```

===
# Mode: function

```typescript [highlight:function]
function add(a: number, b: number): number {
    return a + b;
}

function multiply(a: number, b: number): number {
    return a * b;
}
```

===
# Mode: class

```python [highlight:class]
class Animal:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name
    
    def speak(self):
        pass

class Dog(Animal):
    def speak(self):
        return "Woof!"
```

===
# Manual Lines & Start

```javascript [lines:'1-2|4']
console.log("Line 1-2 highlighted");
console.log("Together");
console.log("Not highlighted");
console.log("Line 4 highlighted");
```

```python [start:10]
# Line numbers start at 10
def process():
    return True
```

===
::: {background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%)'; padding: '40px'; border-radius: '15px'; color: 'white'; text-align: 'center'}
## Part 3: Synchronized Fragments
:::

===
# Sync: line-by-line (replace)

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'; align-items: 'start'}

```javascript [highlight:line-by-line]
let x = 0;
x = x + 5;
x = x * 2;
console.log(x);
```

:::[sync-fragments]
x = 0
[---]
x = 5
[---]
x = 10
[---]
Output: 10
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
# Sync: line-by-line (keep)

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'; align-items: 'start'}

```python [highlight:line-by-line]
count = 0
count += 10
count *= 3
print(count)
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
count = 0
[---]
count = 10
[---]
count = 30
[---]
Output: 30
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
# Sync: with images

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'; align-items: 'start'}

```python [highlight:line-by-line]
data = load_data()
cleaned = process(data)
result = analyze(cleaned)
```

:::[sync-fragments]
![Raw](https://placehold.co/400x200/3498db/white?text=Raw+Data)
[---]
![Cleaned](https://placehold.co/400x200/2ecc71/white?text=Cleaned)
[---]
![Results](https://placehold.co/400x200/e74c3c/white?text=Results)
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
# Sync: mixed content

::: {display: 'grid'; grid-template-columns: '1fr 1fr'; gap: '2em'; align-items: 'start'}

```java [highlight:line-by-line]
User user = new User("Alice");
user.setAge(25);
user.setRole("Admin");
System.out.println(user);
```

:::[sync-fragments keep]
User: name="Alice"
[---]
Updated: age=25
[---]
Updated: role="Admin"
[---]
![User](https://placehold.co/300x150/9b59b6/white?text=User+Object)
:::[sync-fragments]

:::

===
::: {background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #a8edea 0%, #fed6e3 100%)'; padding: '40px'; border-radius: '15px'; color: '#2c3e50'; text-align: 'center'}
## Part 4: LaTeX
:::

===
# LaTeX Equations

Inline: $E = mc^2$

Display:

```latex
x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}
```

===
# Calculus

```latex
\int_{a}^{b} f(x) \, dx = F(b) - F(a)
```

```latex
\lim_{x \to \infty} \frac{1}{x} = 0
```

===
# Matrix

```latex
\begin{pmatrix}
a & b \\
c & d
\end{pmatrix}
\begin{pmatrix}
x \\
y
\end{pmatrix}
=
\begin{pmatrix}
ax + by \\
cx + dy
\end{pmatrix}
```

===
