## Part 9: Fragment Animations
:::

===
# Fragment Animations

::: {.fragment}
Fragment animations let you **reveal content incrementally**
:::

::: {.fragment .fade-up}
This text slides up while fading in
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-blue}
And this one highlights in blue!
:::

===
# Various Fragment Effects

::: {.fragment .fade-out}
This will fade out
:::

::: {.fragment .grow}
This will grow larger
:::

::: {.fragment .shrink}
This will shrink
:::

::: {.fragment .strike}
This gets struck through
:::

===
# Nested Fragments

::: {.fragment .fade-in}
::: {.fragment .highlight-red}
::: {.fragment .semi-fade-out}
Fade in → Turn red → Semi fade out
:::
:::
:::

===
# Custom Order

::: {.fragment fragment-index=3}
**Third**: This appears last
:::

::: {.fragment fragment-index=1}
**First**: This appears first
:::

::: {.fragment fragment-index=2}
**Second**: This appears in the middle
:::

===
# Fragments with Lists

::: {.fragment}
- First batch of items
- Appears together
:::

::: {.fragment .highlight-green}
- Second batch
- Highlights in green
:::

===
