## Part 10: Slide Transitions
:::

===
{transition: "fade"}

# Slide Transitions

This presentation uses the **"slide"** transition globally (set in metadata).

But **individual slides** can override it!

This slide uses the **fade** transition.

===
{transition: "zoom"}

# Zoom Effect

This slide **zooms in** from the center!

Different transitions add visual variety to presentations.

===
{transition: "convex"}

# More Transitions

This uses the **convex** transition.

Available: `none`, `fade`, `slide`, `convex`, `concave`, `zoom`

===
{transition: "fade-in slide-out"}

# Mixed Transitions

You can even use **different in/out transitions**!

This slide: **fade-in slide-out**

===
